# FreeCell (FREECELL.PRG) session on the text shell: sh tests/shots.sh EMU SD freecell 50 T1 ...
# made by hand from absolute places (the content is at 104, 36 on the screen; the pointer
# starts in the bottom right corner). Shot times (s):
#   5.8   game 1 as dealt (freecell -g 1)    6.9   the three of hearts carried
#   9.3   dropped; three cards went home     10.7  a right click: the eight of clubs to a cell
#   12    the six of spades selected         14    clicked onto the seven of diamonds
#   15.5  U: undone                          20.5  Game > Statistics (one game played)
#   23    Help > How to play                 24.9  G: the game number dialog, 123 typed
#   26.5  game 123                           28.4  Help > About FreeCell
#   33    the test position (freecell -w)    35.3  the queen of spades carried
#   44    the win: the display, the banner   46.5  Game > Statistics (two played, one won)
1000 M 127:127:0:0
+20 M 127:127:0:0
+20 M 127:127:0:0
1500 {esc}
+1500 freecell -g 1\n
